title: IntroRini
---
Rini: Hi, I apologize for revealing our secret like that.
Rini: I was being careless, silly me.
Rini: I just wish we wouldn't need to hide our identities.
Rini: But oh well. 
Rini: Did you meet Mr. Penelope? How did it go?
-> He offered me a job here until I can be trusted with your secret.
Rini: Ah, that seems fair enough!
Rini: Welcome to our little Shapeshifting community! 
Rini: What will you be working as?
-> As a tarot reader.
    Rini: Wow, that's so neat! Could you do a reading for me?
    -> Sure.
    Rini: Amazing, let's get started!
-> As a fortune teller. 
    Rini: Oh wow! That's so cool! Could you predict my future? 
    -> Sure. 
    Rini: Amazing, let's get started!
===
